Output assets/codex-midline-slash-completion.gif

Require codex

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontFamily "JetBrains Mono"
Set FontSize 24
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Padding 24
Set BorderRadius 10
Set WindowBar ColorfulRight
Set Framerate 24
Set TypingSpeed 65ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "codex -s workspace-write -a on-request"
Enter
Sleep 12s
Ctrl+L
Sleep 1s
Show

Type "Improve this page with /seo-naver-upgrade"
Sleep 4s
Enter
Sleep 4s

Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
Ctrl+C
